{%- comment -%} Collection template ported from the "Medicines & Health" design
    (banner variants from the Sale / New In / Bundles designs). {%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} Only the 12 department pages carry an image banner. Groups (30),
    brands (88) and leaves (163) use a text-only hero.

    Why: on a 390px phone the image banner pushes the first product to y=856,
    below the 844px fold; the text hero puts it at y=678, above it. The banner
    is also the LCP element, so dropping it moves LCP from a network-bound image
    to the H1 text. Departments keep theirs — they are the campaign and nav
    landing pages, where framing does a job.

    An unknown handle (a collection the client creates later) falls through to
    the image banner, so behaviour there is unchanged. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture cat_level -%}{%- render 'category-level', collection: collection -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign cat_level = cat_level | strip -%}

{%- comment -%} Banner copy, resolved once for all three hero variants below.
    [threshold] prints the free delivery amount from Brand settings, so copy
    written in the editor cannot drift from the number the cart and the bag
    drawer actually enforce. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture fd_amount -%}{%- render 'free-delivery-amount' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture banner_copy -%}{%- if section.settings.banner_text != blank -%}{{ section.settings.banner_text }}{%- else -%}{{ collection.description }}{%- endif -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign banner_copy = banner_copy | replace: '[threshold]', fd_amount | strip -%}

{%- liquid
  assign banner_heading = section.settings.banner_heading | default: collection.title

  comment
    Banner source resolves to an image OBJECT where possible so banner-image.liquid
    can emit a real srcset. banner_asset covers the theme-asset fallback, which has
    no image object behind it and so can only be a single URL.
  endcomment
  assign banner_object = nil
  assign banner_asset = ''
  if section.settings.banner_image
    assign banner_object = section.settings.banner_image
  elsif collection.image
    assign banner_object = collection.image
  elsif section.settings.banner_image_asset != blank
    assign banner_asset = section.settings.banner_image_asset | asset_url
  endif
-%}


<!-- Breadcrumb + category banner -->
<section style="max-width:1440px; margin:0 auto; padding:24px 30px 6px;">
  <nav style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-size:13px; color:#8b9182; margin:0 0 16px;">
    {%- render 'category-breadcrumb', collection: collection -%}
  </nav>

  {%- if section.settings.banner_style == 'sale' -%}
    <div class="banner-flex" style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; background:#f7eeee; min-height:clamp(180px,19vw,252px);">
      <div class="banner-body" style="flex:1 1 380px; padding:clamp(22px,2.6vw,34px) clamp(22px,3vw,40px); display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; gap:10px;">
        {%- if section.settings.banner_badge != blank -%}
          <span style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; width:fit-content; height:28px; padding:0 12px; border-radius:6px; background:#c0392b; color:#ffffff; font-size:12px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase;">{{ section.settings.banner_badge }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
        <h1 style="font-family:'Arial Rounded MT Bold', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:800; color:#8f2c20; font-size:clamp(27px,3vw,40px); line-height:1.08; margin:0;">{{ banner_heading }}</h1>
        <div style="font-size:16.5px; line-height:1.65; color:#5c3a35; max-width:46ch;">
          {{ banner_copy }}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="banner-img" style="position:relative; flex:1 1 320px; min-height:clamp(150px,17vw,252px); overflow:hidden; background-color:#e9ede3;">
        {%- render 'banner-image', image: banner_object, asset: banner_asset, alt: banner_heading, label: 'Sale banner', note: 'Landscape — keep the subject centred, edges get cropped.' -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- elsif cat_level == 'group' or cat_level == 'leaf' or cat_level == 'brand' -%}
    {%- comment -%} Text-only hero: heading and copy sit side by side and use the
        width the image used to take, rather than leaving a wide empty band. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="banner-text" style="border-radius:18px; background:#f4f5f2; padding:clamp(24px,3vw,40px) clamp(24px,3.4vw,48px); display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:clamp(10px,2.4vw,44px);">
      <h1 style="flex:1 1 300px; min-width:0; font-family:'Arial Rounded MT Bold', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:800; color:#3f6b4f; font-size:clamp(28px,3.2vw,44px); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-.01em; margin:0;">{{ banner_heading }}</h1>
      {%- if banner_copy != blank -%}
        <div class="banner-copy" style="flex:1 1 380px; min-width:0; font-size:clamp(14.5px,1.15vw,16px); line-height:1.6; color:#3a3d39; max-width:62ch; border-left:3px solid #dfe4d7; padding-left:clamp(14px,1.6vw,22px);">{{ banner_copy }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    <div class="banner-flex" style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden; background:#f4f5f2; min-height:clamp(180px,19vw,252px);">
      <div class="banner-body" style="flex:1 1 440px; padding:clamp(22px,2.6vw,38px) clamp(22px,3vw,44px); display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;">
        <h1 style="font-family:'Arial Rounded MT Bold', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:800; color:#3f6b4f; font-size:clamp(28px,3.2vw,44px); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-.01em; margin:0 0 12px;">{{ banner_heading }}</h1>
        <div class="banner-copy" style="font-size:clamp(14.5px,1.15vw,16px); line-height:1.55; color:#3a3d39; max-width:560px;">
          {{ banner_copy }}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="banner-img" style="position:relative; flex:1 1 360px; background-color:#e9ede3; min-height:clamp(150px,17vw,252px); overflow:hidden;">
        {%- render 'banner-image', image: banner_object, asset: banner_asset, alt: banner_heading, label: 'Category banner', note: 'Landscape — keep the subject centred, edges get cropped.' -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>

{%- if section.settings.show_chips -%}
<!-- Sub-category chips -->
<section style="max-width:1440px; margin:0 auto; padding:22px 30px 8px;">
  <div class="cat-tile-row" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px;">
    <button class="chip-arrow hov-chip-arrow" aria-label="Scroll back" data-rail-btn data-rail-back data-rail-target="chips-track" data-rail-by="-372" style="flex:0 0 auto; width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:999px; border:1.5px solid #cfd1cc; background:#fff; color:#82C914; cursor:pointer; display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:center;"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 6 9 12 15 18"></polyline></svg></button>
    <div id="chips-track" style="flex:1; display:flex; gap:16px; overflow-x:auto; scrollbar-width:none; padding-bottom:4px;">
      {%- if section.settings.chip_links != blank -%}
        {%- assign chip_lines = section.settings.chip_links | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
        {%- for line in chip_lines -%}
          {%- assign parts = line | strip | split: '|' -%}
          {%- if parts.size >= 2 -%}
            <a href="{{ parts[1] | strip }}" class="hov-bg-green-dk" style="flex:0 0 auto; min-width:170px; background:#82C914; color:#ffffff; font-weight:700; font-size:14.5px; text-align:center; height:50px; padding:0 18px; border-radius:9px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">{{ parts[0] | strip }}</a>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- render 'category-chips', collection: collection -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <button class="chip-arrow hov-chip-arrow" aria-label="Scroll for more" data-rail-btn data-rail-target="chips-track" data-rail-by="372" style="flex:0 0 auto; width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:999px; border:1.5px solid #cfd1cc; background:#fff; color:#82C914; cursor:pointer; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 6 15 12 9 18"></polyline></svg></button>
  </div>
  <div class="chip-progress" style="display:none; margin-top:16px; height:4px; border-radius:999px; background:#e2e4df; overflow:hidden;"><div style="height:100%; border-radius:999px; background:#92C83F; width:12%; transition:width .15s ease;"></div></div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}

<!-- Filter / Sort bar -->
<section style="max-width:1440px; margin:0 auto; padding:26px 30px 0;">
  <div class="fs-bar" style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:14px 26px; border-bottom:1px solid #e6e7e4; padding-bottom:20px;">
    <button class="filter-toggle" data-filter-toggle aria-controls="filters-{{ section.id }}" aria-expanded="true" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; background:transparent; border:none; cursor:pointer; font-family:inherit; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; color:#2A2B2A;">
      Filter
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#82C914" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" y1="7" x2="20" y2="7"></line><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="2.4" fill="#fff"></circle><line x1="4" y1="17" x2="20" y2="17"></line><circle cx="15" cy="17" r="2.4" fill="#fff"></circle></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="sortby-box" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; border:1.5px solid #82C914; border-radius:9px; padding:12px 16px;">
      <span style="font-weight:700; font-size:15px; color:#2A2B2A;">Sort by:</span>
      <select data-sort-select aria-label="Sort by" style="border:none; background:transparent; outline:none; font-family:inherit; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; color:#82C914; cursor:pointer;">
        {%- assign current_sort = collection.sort_by | default: collection.default_sort_by -%}
        {%- for option in collection.sort_options -%}
          <option value="{{ option.value }}" {% if option.value == current_sort %}selected{% endif %}>{{ option.name }}</option>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </select>
    </div>
    <span class="prod-count" style="margin-left:auto; font-size:14px; color:#8b9182;">{{ collection.products_count }} products</span>
    <button class="refine-mobile" data-filter-toggle aria-controls="filters-{{ section.id }}" aria-expanded="false" style="display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:9px; width:100%; background:transparent; border:1.5px solid #82C914; border-radius:9px; padding:14px 18px; cursor:pointer; font-family:inherit; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; color:#2A2B2A;">
      Refine By
      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#82C914" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" y1="7" x2="20" y2="7"></line><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="2.4" fill="#fff"></circle><line x1="4" y1="17" x2="20" y2="17"></line><circle cx="15" cy="17" r="2.4" fill="#fff"></circle></svg>
    </button>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Active filter removal chips {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign has_active = false -%}
  {%- for filter in collection.filters -%}
    {%- if filter.active_values.size > 0 or filter.min_value.value != blank or filter.max_value.value != blank -%}{%- assign has_active = true -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- if has_active -%}
    <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:9px; padding:16px 0 0;">
      {%- for filter in collection.filters -%}
        {%- for value in filter.active_values -%}
          <a href="{{ value.url_to_remove }}" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; height:32px; padding:0 12px; border-radius:999px; background:#eef2e8; color:#3f6b4f; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:700;">{{ value.label }} <span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:15px; line-height:1;">&times;</span></a>
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- if filter.type == 'price_range' -%}
          {%- if filter.min_value.value != blank or filter.max_value.value != blank -%}
            <a href="{{ filter.url_to_remove }}" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; height:32px; padding:0 12px; border-radius:999px; background:#eef2e8; color:#3f6b4f; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:700;">{{ filter.min_value.value | default: 0 | money }} &ndash; {{ filter.max_value.value | default: filter.range_max | money }} <span aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:15px; line-height:1;">&times;</span></a>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      <a href="{{ collection.url }}" class="hov-green" style="font-size:13.5px; font-weight:700; color:#8b9182; margin-left:4px;">Clear all</a>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>

{% paginate collection.products by 24 %}
<!-- Sidebar + grid -->
<section style="max-width:1440px; margin:0 auto; padding:24px 30px 8px;">
  <div class="col-wrap" style="display:flex; gap:40px; align-items:flex-start;">

    <!-- Filter sidebar -->
    <aside class="filter-side" id="filters-{{ section.id }}" style="flex:0 0 260px; width:260px; position:sticky; top:16px;">
      {%- for filter in collection.filters -%}
        {%- case filter.type -%}
          {%- when 'list', 'boolean' -%}
            <div style="margin-bottom:30px; {% unless forloop.first %}border-top:1px solid #e6e7e4; padding-top:24px;{% endunless %}">
              <h3 style="font-family:'Arial Rounded MT Bold', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; color:#82C914; font-size:20px; margin:0 0 18px;">{{ filter.label }}</h3>
              <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;">
                {%- for value in filter.values -%}
                  <a href="{% if value.active %}{{ value.url_to_remove }}{% else %}{{ value.url_to_add }}{% endif %}" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; font-size:15px; color:#2A2B2A; {% if value.count == 0 and value.active == false %}opacity:.45; pointer-events:none;{% endif %}">
                    <span style="flex:0 0 auto; width:22px; height:22px; border-radius:5px; border:2px solid {% if value.active %}#5E8A1F{% else %}#c2c6bd{% endif %}; background:{% if value.active %}#5E8A1F{% else %}#ffffff{% endif %}; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
                      <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="opacity:{% if value.active %}1{% else %}0{% endif %};"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                    </span>
                    <span style="flex:1;">{{ value.label }}</span>
                    <span style="color:#a7ada0; font-size:14px;">({{ value.count }})</span>
                  </a>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- when 'price_range' -%}
            <div style="{% unless forloop.first %}border-top:1px solid #e6e7e4; padding-top:24px;{% endunless %}">
              <h3 style="font-family:'Arial Rounded MT Bold', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; color:#82C914; font-size:20px; margin:0 0 18px;">{{ filter.label }}</h3>
              <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:18px;">
                <div style="flex:1; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; border:1.5px solid #dfe1dc; border-radius:8px; padding:9px 11px;"><span style="color:#8b9182;">{{ cart.currency.symbol | default: '€' }}</span><input data-price-input name="{{ filter.min_value.param_name }}" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="0" value="{% if filter.min_value.value %}{{ filter.min_value.value | money_without_currency | remove: ',' }}{% endif %}" style="width:100%; border:none; outline:none; font-family:inherit; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; color:#2A2B2A; padding:0;"></div>
                <span style="color:#8b9182;">&ndash;</span>
                <div style="flex:1; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; border:1.5px solid #dfe1dc; border-radius:8px; padding:9px 11px;"><span style="color:#8b9182;">{{ cart.currency.symbol | default: '€' }}</span><input data-price-input name="{{ filter.max_value.param_name }}" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="{{ filter.range_max | money_without_currency | remove: ',' }}" value="{% if filter.max_value.value %}{{ filter.max_value.value | money_without_currency | remove: ',' }}{% endif %}" style="width:100%; border:none; outline:none; font-family:inherit; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; color:#2A2B2A; padding:0;"></div>
              </div>
              <button data-price-apply class="hov-bg-green-dk" style="width:100%; border:none; border-radius:8px; background:#82C914; color:#ffffff; font-family:inherit; font-weight:700; font-size:14.5px; padding:11px 8px; cursor:pointer;">Apply</button>
            </div>
        {%- endcase -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- if collection.filters.size == 0 -%}
        <p style="margin:0; font-size:14px; color:#8b9182; line-height:1.6;">No filters are available for this collection yet. Filters can be configured in the Shopify admin under Online Store &rsaquo; Navigation &rsaquo; Collection and search filters.</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </aside>

    <!-- Product grid -->
    <div style="flex:1; min-width:0;">
      {%- if collection.products.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="pgrid" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(210px,1fr)); gap:26px 22px;">
        {%- for product in collection.products -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
            assign on_sale = false
            if product.compare_at_price > product.price
              assign on_sale = true
            endif
            assign quick_add = false
            if product.available and product.variants.size == 1 and product.selling_plan_groups.size == 0
              assign quick_add = true
            endif
            comment
              A restricted product never gets a one-click add — the shopper is sent to
              the product page instead. See snippets/product-restricted.liquid.
            endcomment
            capture restricted
              render 'product-restricted', product: product
            endcapture
            assign restricted = restricted | strip
            if restricted == 'true'
              assign quick_add = false
            endif
          -%}
          <div class="pcard" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
            <div class="pcard-img" style="position:relative; aspect-ratio:1; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #eceee9; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:14px;">
              {%- if on_sale -%}
                <span style="position:absolute; top:12px; left:12px; z-index:2; background:#c0392b; color:#fff; font-weight:800; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.04em; padding:5px 10px; border-radius:6px;">SALE</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <a href="{{ product.url | within: collection }}" style="display:block; width:100%; height:100%;">
                {%- if product.featured_image -%}
                  {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', style: 'width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain; display:block; transition:transform .3s ease;' }}
                {%- else -%}
                  <span style="display:flex; width:100%; height:100%; background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#dfe6d5,#dfe6d5 12px,#d7dfcb 12px,#d7dfcb 24px); align-items:center; justify-content:center;"><span style="font-family:ui-monospace,monospace; font-size:11px; color:#5a7a2e; font-weight:700;">image</span></span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </a>
              {%- if quick_add -%}
                <button data-add-id="{{ variant.id }}" class="pcard-view pcard-hovbtn" style="position:absolute; left:14px; right:14px; bottom:14px; background:#fff; border:1.5px solid #dfe1dc; color:#2A2B2A; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; text-align:center; padding:6px 8px; border-radius:7px; opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px); transition:opacity .2s ease, transform .2s ease; cursor:pointer;">Add To Bag</button>
              {%- else -%}
                <a href="{{ product.url | within: collection }}" class="pcard-view pcard-hovbtn" style="position:absolute; left:14px; right:14px; bottom:14px; background:#fff; border:1.5px solid #dfe1dc; color:#2A2B2A; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; text-align:center; padding:6px 8px; border-radius:7px; opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px); transition:opacity .2s ease, transform .2s ease;">View Product</a>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#82C914; margin-bottom:6px;">{{ product.vendor }}</div>
            <h3 style="font-weight:600; font-size:15px; line-height:1.35; margin:0 0 10px; min-height:41px;"><a href="{{ product.url | within: collection }}" class="hov-green" style="color:#2A2B2A;">{{ product.title }}</a></h3>
            <div style="margin-bottom:14px; min-height:18px;">{% render 'product-rating', product: product, size: 14 %}</div>
            <div style="margin-top:auto; border-top:1px solid #eceee9; padding-top:12px; display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:9px;">
              <span style="color:#82C914; font-weight:800; font-size:20px;">{% if product.price_varies %}From {% endif %}{{ product.price | money }}</span>
              {%- if on_sale -%}
                <span style="color:#a7ada0; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; text-decoration:line-through;">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
            {%- if quick_add -%}
              <button data-add-id="{{ variant.id }}" class="pcard-mobile-btn hov-bg-green" style="display:none; margin-top:12px; text-align:center; background:#92C83F; color:#fff; font-weight:700; font-size:15px; padding:12px 8px; border-radius:8px; border:none; width:100%; cursor:pointer; font-family:inherit;">Add To Bag</button>
            {%- else -%}
              <a href="{{ product.url | within: collection }}" class="pcard-mobile-btn hov-bg-green" style="display:none; margin-top:12px; text-align:center; background:#92C83F; color:#fff; font-weight:700; font-size:15px; padding:12px 8px; border-radius:8px;">View Product</a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      <!-- Pagination -->
      {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; margin:44px 0 8px;">
          {%- for part in paginate.parts -%}
            {%- if part.is_link -%}
              <a href="{{ part.url }}" class="hov-border-accent" style="min-width:40px; height:40px; padding:0 6px; border-radius:8px; border:1.5px solid #dfe1dc; color:#2A2B2A; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">{{ part.title }}</a>
            {%- elsif part.title contains 'hellip' or part.title == '…' -%}
              <span style="min-width:40px; height:40px; padding:0 6px; border-radius:8px; color:#8b9182; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">{{ part.title }}</span>
            {%- else -%}
              <span style="min-width:40px; height:40px; padding:0 6px; border-radius:8px; background:#82C914; color:#fff; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">{{ part.title }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- if paginate.next -%}
            <a href="{{ paginate.next.url }}" class="hov-border-accent" style="min-width:40px; height:40px; padding:0 12px; border-radius:8px; border:1.5px solid #dfe1dc; color:#2A2B2A; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px;">Next<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 6 15 12 9 18"></polyline></svg></a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- else -%}
      <!-- Empty collection -->
      <div style="border:1px solid #eceee9; border-radius:16px; padding:clamp(36px,5vw,64px) 30px; text-align:center;">
        <h2 style="font-family:'Arial Rounded MT Bold', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:800; color:#3f6b4f; font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px); margin:0 0 12px;">
          {%- if has_active -%}No products match your filters{%- else -%}No products here yet{%- endif -%}
        </h2>
        <p style="margin:0 auto 22px; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.65; color:#5a6153; max-width:52ch;">
          {%- if has_active -%}Try removing a filter, or clear them all to see the full range.{%- else -%}Products added to this collection will appear here. In the meantime, browse the rest of the shop.{%- endif -%}
        </p>
        {%- if has_active -%}
          <a href="{{ collection.url }}" class="hov-bg-green-dk" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; height:48px; padding:0 26px; border-radius:9px; background:#82C914; color:#ffffff; font-weight:800; font-size:15px;">Clear all filters</a>
        {%- else -%}
          <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="hov-bg-green-dk" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; height:48px; padding:0 26px; border-radius:9px; background:#82C914; color:#ffffff; font-weight:800; font-size:15px;">Continue shopping</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endpaginate %}

{%- if section.settings.seo_heading != blank or section.settings.seo_text != blank or section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
<!-- SEO copy + FAQ -->
<section style="max-width:1440px; margin:0 auto; padding:48px 30px 8px;">
  {%- if section.settings.seo_heading != blank -%}
    <h2 style="font-family:'Arial Rounded MT Bold', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:800; color:#3f6b4f; font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,40px); line-height:1.1; margin:0 0 20px;">{{ section.settings.seo_heading }}</h2>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.seo_text != blank -%}
    <div class="seo-copy" style="margin:0 0 40px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#3a3d39; max-width:1000px;">{{ section.settings.seo_text }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
    <h2 style="font-family:'Arial Rounded MT Bold', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:800; color:#3f6b4f; font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,34px); margin:0 0 26px;">{{ section.settings.faq_heading }}</h2>
    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #eceee9; padding:22px 0;" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          {%- comment -%} Only the first answer starts open — a wall of expanded FAQs
              buries the rest of the page. {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if forloop.first -%}{%- assign faq_open = 'true' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign faq_open = 'false' -%}{%- endif -%}
          <button data-acc-toggle="faq-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index }}" aria-expanded="{{ faq_open }}" aria-controls="faq-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index }}" style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:14px; width:100%; background:transparent; border:none; padding:0; cursor:pointer; text-align:left;">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Arial Rounded MT Bold', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; color:#2A2B2A; font-size:clamp(18px,1.8vw,22px); margin:0;">{{ block.settings.question }}</h3>
            <svg data-acc-chevron width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#82C914" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex:0 0 auto; transform:rotate({% if forloop.first %}180{% else %}0{% endif %}deg); transition:transform .2s ease;"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-content" id="faq-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index }}" data-acc-content="faq-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index }}" data-open="{{ faq_open }}">
            <p style="margin:10px 0 0; font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.65; color:#5a6153; max-width:1000px;">{{ block.settings.answer | replace: '[threshold]', fd_amount }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>
{%- endif -%}

{%- liquid
  assign also_col = section.settings.also_collection
  if also_col == blank
    assign also_col = collection
  endif
-%}
{%- if section.settings.show_also and also_col.products.size > 0 -%}
<!-- You may also like -->
<section style="max-width:1440px; margin:0 auto; padding:44px 30px 8px;">
  <h2 style="font-family:'Arial Rounded MT Bold', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:800; color:#3f6b4f; font-size:clamp(22px,2.4vw,30px); margin:0 0 24px;">{{ section.settings.also_heading }}</h2>
  <div style="position:relative;">
    <div id="also-track-{{ section.id }}" style="display:flex; gap:22px; overflow-x:auto; scroll-behavior:smooth; scrollbar-width:none; padding:4px;">
      {%- for product in also_col.products limit: 6 -%}
        <div style="flex:0 0 240px; border:1px solid #eceee9; border-radius:16px; padding:18px; display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
          <a href="{{ product.url }}" style="aspect-ratio:1; border-radius:10px; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #eceee9; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-bottom:14px; overflow:hidden;">
            {%- if product.featured_image -%}
              {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 480 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', style: 'width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain; display:block;' }}
            {%- else -%}
              <span style="display:flex; width:100%; height:100%; background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#dfe6d5,#dfe6d5 12px,#d7dfcb 12px,#d7dfcb 24px); align-items:center; justify-content:center;"><span style="font-family:ui-monospace,monospace; font-size:11px; color:#5a7a2e; font-weight:700;">image</span></span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </a>
          <div style="font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#82C914; margin-bottom:6px;">{{ product.vendor }}</div>
          <h3 style="font-weight:600; font-size:15px; line-height:1.35; margin:0 0 10px; min-height:41px;"><a href="{{ product.url }}" class="hov-green" style="color:#2A2B2A;">{{ product.title }}</a></h3>
          <div style="margin-bottom:12px;">{% render 'product-rating', product: product, size: 14 %}</div>
          <div style="color:#82C914; font-weight:800; font-size:19px; margin-bottom:14px;">{% if product.price_varies %}From {% endif %}{{ product.price | money }}</div>
          <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="hov-bg-green" style="margin-top:auto; text-align:center; background:#92C83F; color:#fff; font-weight:700; font-size:15px; padding:12px 16px; border-radius:8px;">View Product</a>
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    <button aria-label="Scroll back" data-rail-btn data-rail-back data-rail-target="also-track-{{ section.id }}" data-rail-by="-540" class="hov-chip-arrow" style="position:absolute; left:-14px; top:calc(50% - 20px); transform:translateY(-50%); width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:999px; border:1.5px solid #cfd1cc; background:#fff; color:#82C914; cursor:pointer; display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1);"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 6 9 12 15 18"></polyline></svg></button>
    <button aria-label="Scroll forward" data-rail-btn data-rail-target="also-track-{{ section.id }}" data-rail-by="540" class="hov-chip-arrow" style="position:absolute; right:-14px; top:calc(50% - 20px); transform:translateY(-50%); width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:999px; border:1.5px solid #cfd1cc; background:#fff; color:#82C914; cursor:pointer; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.1);"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 6 15 12 9 18"></polyline></svg></button>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}

{% style %}
  .banner-copy p, .seo-copy p { margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .banner-copy p:last-child, .seo-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .hov-chip-arrow:hover { border-color: #92C83F !important; background: #f2f8e9 !important; }
  .pcard-hovbtn:hover { background: #92C83F !important; color: #fff !important; border-color: #92C83F !important; }
  .pcard:hover .pcard-view { opacity: 1 !important; transform: translateY(0) !important; }
  .pcard:hover .pcard-img img { transform: scale(1.04); }
  .faq-content[data-open="false"] { display: none; }
  .filter-side input[type=number]::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
  .filter-side input[type=number]::-webkit-inner-spin-button { -webkit-appearance: none; margin: 0; }
  .filter-side input[type=number] { -moz-appearance: textfield; appearance: textfield; }
  /* Filter sidebar visibility. The toggle sets BOTH classes at once; each
     breakpoint reads the one that applies, so the button works everywhere:
     wide screens open by default and collapse on click, narrow screens are
     closed by default and open on click. The mobile rules come later in the
     sheet, so .is-open wins there at equal specificity. */
  .filter-side.is-collapsed { display: none; }
  @media (min-width: 961px) {
    /* Sticky pins the sidebar, so a long list (Brand can run to dozens of
       values) would extend past the viewport with no way to reach the bottom. */
    .filter-side { max-height: calc(100vh - 32px); overflow-y: auto; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .col-wrap { align-items: stretch !important; flex-direction: column !important; }
    .filter-side { flex: 1 1 auto !important; width: 100% !important; position: static !important; }
    .filter-side { display: none; }
    .filter-side.is-open { display: block; }
    .filter-toggle { display: inline-flex !important; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    /* Stacked: reset flex-basis to auto, or the basis set for the ROW (440px/360px)
       becomes a forced HEIGHT and the banner balloons past a phone viewport.
       Text sizes itself to its copy; the image becomes a landscape band. */
    /* text-only hero: the rule between heading and copy moves above the copy once stacked */
    .banner-text .banner-copy {
      border-left: 0 !important; padding-left: 0 !important;
      border-top: 3px solid #dfe4d7; padding-top: 16px;
    }
    .banner-flex { flex-direction: column !important; min-height: 0 !important; }
    .banner-body { flex: 0 0 auto !important; }
    .banner-img {
      flex: 0 0 auto !important;
      min-height: 0 !important;
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      max-height: 260px;   /* 16:9 gets tall near 900px — keep the band letterboxed */
    }
    .pgrid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)) !important; }
    /* Category labels run long ("Baby & Children Pain Relief"), so each chip
       sizes to its own text instead of being squeezed into the shared 120px
       homepage width and wrapping to two cramped lines. min-width still holds
       the floor for short labels. ID beats the .cat-tile-row rule in base.css. */
    #chips-track a {
      flex: 0 0 auto !important;
      width: auto !important;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .chip-arrow { display: none !important; }
    .chip-progress { display: block !important; }
    .fs-bar { flex-direction: column !important; align-items: stretch !important; gap: 12px !important; }
    .filter-toggle { display: none !important; }
    .sortby-box { width: 100% !important; justify-content: space-between !important; }
    .sortby-box select { flex: 1; text-align: right; }
    .prod-count { display: none !important; }
    .refine-mobile { display: flex !important; }
    .pcard-view { display: none !important; }
    .pcard-mobile-btn { display: block !important; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<script>
  (() => {
    // Mobile "Refine By" / desktop "Filter" toggle (design's filterOpen state).
    // aria-expanded is read back off the computed style rather than tracked in
    // JS, because the default differs by breakpoint and can change on resize.
    const side = document.querySelector('.filter-side');
    const fbtns = document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter-toggle]');
    if (side && fbtns.length) {
      const syncAria = () => {
        const open = getComputedStyle(side).display !== 'none';
        fbtns.forEach(b => b.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open)));
      };
      fbtns.forEach(btn => btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        side.classList.toggle('is-collapsed');
        side.classList.toggle('is-open');
        syncAria();
      }));
      window.addEventListener('resize', syncAria);
      syncAria();
    }

    // Sort select -> sort_by URL param
    const sel = document.querySelector('[data-sort-select]');
    if (sel) sel.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const u = new URL(location.href);
      u.searchParams.set('sort_by', sel.value);
      u.searchParams.delete('page');
      location.href = u.href;
    });

    // Price range apply -> filter.v.price params
    const apply = document.querySelector('[data-price-apply]');
    if (apply) apply.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const u = new URL(location.href);
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-price-input]').forEach(inp => {
        u.searchParams.delete(inp.name);
        if (inp.value) u.searchParams.set(inp.name, inp.value);
      });
      u.searchParams.delete('page');
      location.href = u.href;
    });

    // Mobile chip progress bar
    const track = document.getElementById('chips-track');
    const bar = document.querySelector('.chip-progress > div');
    if (track && bar) track.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      const max = track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth;
      const pct = max > 0 ? Math.round((track.scrollLeft / max) * 100) : 0;
      bar.style.width = Math.max(12, pct) + '%';
    }, { passive: true });
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Collection page",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Category banner"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "banner_style",
      "label": "Banner style",
      "options": [
        { "value": "standard", "label": "Standard (green)" },
        { "value": "sale", "label": "Sale (red)" }
      ],
      "default": "standard"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "banner_heading",
      "label": "Banner heading",
      "info": "Leave blank to use the collection title."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "banner_text",
      "label": "Banner text",
      "info": "Leave blank to use the collection description."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "banner_badge",
      "label": "Sale badge text",
      "info": "Shown on the Sale banner style only, e.g. \"Up to 30% off\"."
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "banner_image",
      "label": "Banner image",
      "info": "Falls back to the collection image, then the asset filename below."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "banner_image_asset",
      "label": "Fallback banner asset filename",
      "info": "Leave empty to show a sized placeholder until real photography is uploaded. A default here would put the same photo on every category.",
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Sub-category chips"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_chips",
      "label": "Show chips rail",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "chip_links",
      "label": "Chip links",
      "info": "One per line: Label | URL. Leave blank for the default Medicines & Health category chips."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "SEO copy and FAQ"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "seo_heading",
      "label": "SEO heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "seo_text",
      "label": "SEO text"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "faq_heading",
      "label": "FAQ heading",
      "default": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "You may also like"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_also",
      "label": "Show \"You may also like\" rail",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "also_heading",
      "label": "Rail heading",
      "default": "You may also like"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "also_collection",
      "label": "Rail collection",
      "info": "Leave blank to use products from the current collection."
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "faq",
      "name": "FAQ item",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "question",
          "label": "Question",
          "default": "Do I need a prescription?"
        },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "answer",
          "label": "Answer",
          "default": "All items in this collection can be bought without a GP prescription. Prescription-only medicines are not sold online in Ireland — you can submit a prescription for dispensing instead, and collect it in store or have it delivered."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Collection page"
    }
  ]
}
